%!PS-Adobe-3.0
<< /PageSize [120 100] >> setpagedevice
gsave 5 5 110 90 rectclip
0.2 0.3 0.4 0.1 setcmykcolor 2 setlinewidth
10 10 moveto 50 90 70 10 110 80 curveto stroke grestore
gsave 10 50 translate 40 20 scale
2 1 8 [2 0 0 -1 0 1] <ff000000ff00> false 3 colorimage grestore
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 3 3]
   /XStep 6 /YStep 6 /PaintProc { pop 0 0.5 0 setrgbcolor 0 0 3 3 rectfill }
>> matrix makepattern /tiles exch def
<< /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 40 20] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 60 50]
   /PaintProc { pop tiles setpattern 0 0 40 20 rectfill }
>> execform
showpage
